# =============================================================================
# libre365 - Development/test docker-compose environment (study, 4.6)
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to `.env` before `docker compose up -d`.
#
# As of the k3d dev cluster migration, this compose environment only runs
# two services (grommunio-dev, novu-mock) - everything else in the dev/test
# tier now runs on the local k3d Kubernetes cluster instead, with its own
# environment/values files - see dev-cluster/README.md. The variables below
# only cover what these two remaining services still need.
#
# ALL the password/secret values below are DEVELOPMENT-ONLY values. Never
# reuse them in staging/production: the target secrets management approach
# goes through a dedicated vault (study, 4.5).
# =============================================================================

# --- Ports exposed on localhost (overridable in case of local conflict) ----
# BEGIN GENERATED PORTS (platform.yaml)
# This block is generated from platform.yaml by scripts/sync_platform.py.
# Do not edit by hand: change platform.yaml then re-run the script.
